# Title: Suspicious Git Clone - Linux
# ID: cfec9d29-64ec-4a0f-9ffe-0fdb856d5446
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-01-03
# Tags: attack.reconnaissance, attack.t1593.003
# Description: Detects execution of "git" in order to clone a remote repository that contain suspicious keywords which might be suspicious
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*/git AND cmdline:* clone *) AND ((cmdline:*exploit* OR cmdline:*Vulns* OR cmdline:*vulnerability* OR cmdline:*RCE* OR cmdline:*RemoteCodeExecution* OR cmdline:*Invoke-* OR cmdline:*CVE-* OR cmdline:*poc-* OR cmdline:*ProofOfConcept* OR cmdline:*proxyshell* OR cmdline:*log4shell* OR cmdline:*eternalblue* OR cmdline:*eternal-blue* OR cmdline:*MS17-*)))
